#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:9
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"> Habitat 业务 API（Habitat RPC `POST|WS /rpc/v1` + MCP）须带 **per-subject Service API Token**（`Authorization: Bearer fa_at_...` 或 WS `connect.auth_token`）。\n"
"> Security context: [`security.md`](security.md) · Install: [`install.md`](install.md)\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:22
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid ""
#| "| Layer                   | Role                                                                                                        |\n"
#| "| ----------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
#| "| **Service API Token**   | 绑定 `user` / `agent` subject；REST `Authorization: Bearer`；SAP `connect.auth_token`；MCP `/mcp` 同 Bearer |\n"
#| "| **CLI bootstrap**       | `anima token create --subject-id <id> --name bootstrap`（直连 PG，不经 HTTP）                               |\n"
#| "| **cloudflared**         | Outbound tunnel；single hostname → Habitat `127.0.0.1:2658`（API + Web UI at `/web`）                           |\n"
#| "| **`http.host`**         | Habitat listen bind (IP or resolvable hostname); default `127.0.0.1`; use `0.0.0.0` for LAN                     |\n"
#| "| **`http.cors_origins`** | Explicit cross-origin browser origins (dev:web, split UI/API reverse proxy); independent of Tunnel          |\n"
#| "| **Client settings**     | desktop / mobile shell / **browser Web** fill Habitat URL and token in **Habitat settings**                       |\n"
#| "| **Remote UI**           | Desktop / Mobile 默认从 Habitat `/web/*` 加载 UI；见 [`architecture.md`](../concepts/architecture.md) Client UI |\n"
#| "| **PWA**                 | `/web/*` 支持 manifest + Service Worker；手机浏览器与 APK 共用 compact 布局                                 |\n"
msgid ""
"| Layer                    | Role                                                                                                                               |\n"
"| ------------------------ | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| **Service API Token**    | 绑定 `user` / `agent` subject；Habitat RPC HTTP `Authorization: Bearer`；WS `connect.auth_token`；MCP `/mcp` 同 Bearer                 |\n"
"| **CLI bootstrap**        | `anima token create --subject-id <id> --name bootstrap`（直连 PG，不经 HTTP）                                                      |\n"
"| **`http.host`**          | Habitat listen bind (IP or resolvable hostname); default `127.0.0.1`; use `0.0.0.0` for LAN                                            |\n"
"| **`http.allowed_hosts`** | TLS 证书 SAN 额外主机名 / IP（`http.host: 0.0.0.0` 时列出客户端访问用的名称）；变更后 `auto: true` 时重启自动重签                  |\n"
"| **`http.cors_origins`**  | Explicit cross-origin browser origins (dev:web, split UI/API reverse proxy)                                                        |\n"
"| **Client settings**      | Desktop / mobile shell / **browser Web** fill Habitat URL and token in **Habitat settings**                                                |\n"
"| **Remote UI**            | 浏览器/PWA 从 Habitat `/web/*` 加载；Desktop/Mobile 默认安装包内本地 UI；见 [`architecture.md`](../concepts/architecture.md) Client UI |\n"
"| **PWA**                  | `/web/*` 支持 manifest + Service Worker；手机浏览器与 APK 共用 compact 布局                                                        |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 层级                   | 作用                                                                                                            |\n"
"| ----------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| **Service API Token**   | 绑定 `user` / `agent` subject；REST `Authorization: Bearer`；SAP `connect.auth_token`；MCP `/mcp` 同上 |\n"
"| **CLI bootstrap**       | `anima token create --subject-id <id> --name bootstrap`（直连 PG，不经 HTTP）                                   |\n"
"| **cloudflared**         | 出站隧道；single hostname → Habitat `127.0.0.1:2658`（API + Web UI 位于 `/web`）                                    |\n"
"| **`http.host`**         | Habitat 监听绑定（IP 或可解析主机名）；默认 `127.0.0.1`；局域网用 `0.0.0.0`                                          |\n"
"| **`http.cors_origins`** | 显式跨源浏览器 origin（dev:web、分离式 UI/API 反向代理）；独立于 Tunnel                                         |\n"
"| **客户端设置**          | desktop / mobile shell / **浏览器 Web** 在 **Habitat 设置** 中填写 Habitat URL 与 token                               |\n"
"| **远程 UI**             | Desktop / Mobile 默认从 Habitat `/web/*` 加载 UI；见 [`architecture.md`](../concepts/architecture.md) 的 Client UI |\n"
"| **PWA**                 | `/web/*` 支持 manifest + Service Worker；手机浏览器与 APK 共用 `compact` 布局                                   |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:24
msgid ""
"公网暴露不在产品内置范围内：请使用局域网、`http.tls` 本地 HTTPS，或自行搭建反"
"向代理 / VPN。旧版 `tunnel` 配置段已废弃并忽略。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "PWA（浏览器 Web）"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:36
msgid ""
"**Secure context**：Service Worker 需要 HTTPS 或 `localhost`。局域网可用 Habitat "
"本地 HTTPS（`:2659`）或自建 TLS 终止。浏览器 **Web Speech** 朗读同样需安全上"
"下文；默认 **Edge TTS**（Habitat `POST /rpc/v1/tts/synthesize`）在 HTTP 局域"
"网下也可用，但 Habitat 需能访问外网 Microsoft 语音服务。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:36
msgid ""
"**Service Worker vs 安装**：SW 在普通浏览器标签页访问 `/web/*` 时即注册（生产"
"构建）；**不要求**「添加到主屏幕」。安装仅改变启动方式（独立窗口），离线能力"
"与标签页相同。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:36
msgid ""
"**安装（可选）**：手机浏览器访问 `/web/chat`，Chrome / Safari 支持「添加到主"
"屏幕」；生产构建会显示安装引导条（compact 布局、非已安装态）。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:36
msgid ""
"**更新**：Habitat 部署新 Web 静态产物后，已安装 PWA 会提示「新版本可用」；点击重"
"新加载后生效（不会自动刷新）。壳层 JS 由 Workbox precache，生产环境会定期/"
"`visibilitychange` 时 `registration.update()`。`/web/config.json` 始终 `no-"
"store`（Habitat URL 动态）。Desktop/Mobile 不走 SW；升级见 Releases 安装包检测"
"（设置 → 关于「检查更新」）。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:36
msgid "**离线边界（两层）**："
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:36
msgid ""
"**壳层（SW）**：仅缓存 JS/CSS/HTML 等静态资源，保证断网时页面框架可加载。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:36
msgid ""
"**业务快照（IndexedDB）**：Chat / Task / Project / Notification / Diary / "
"Email / Dream / Pomodoro（config/历史）及 Habitat 部分只读页由 `shell-sdk/"
"offline-cache` 做 cache-first；**Tier 2 可写**模块（Diary、Task、Project、"
"Chat send、Pomodoro outbox）离线可编辑，恢复在线后 outbox flush；详见 "
"[`offline-platform.md`](offline-platform.md)。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:36
msgid ""
"**离线边界**：浏览器 `offline` 时 Tier 1 模块只读展示快照；"
"**offlineWritable** 模块（Diary、Task、Project、Chat、Pomodoro）仍可本地编辑"
"并排队待同步。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:36
msgid ""
"**存储**：SW 缓存、localStorage（Habitat 设置）、IndexedDB（业务快照）互不冲突；"
"清除站点数据会同时删除三者。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:38
msgid ""
"Registry 标记 `auth: optional` 的 Habitat RPC 方法（如 `health.probe`、"
"`tls.ca.*`）与 CORS 预检可不带 Bearer；其余 `/rpc/v1/*` 与 MCP 须 "
"Bearer。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:39
#, no-wrap
msgid "1. 创建 token（冷启动）"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
