#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:201
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid ""
#| "| Symptom                | Check                                                               |\n"
#| "| ---------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
#| "| Public 502             | Is Habitat running? `anima service status`                              |\n"
#| "| Public 1033            | `anima tunnel status` shows `connected: no`                         |\n"
#| "| 401                    | Client token valid; run `anima token list --subject-id <id>`        |\n"
#| "| Local OK, remote fails | Remote requests need Bearer / SAP auth_token                        |\n"
#| "| CORS error in browser  | Add UI origin to `http.cors_origins`, or use Habitat `/web` same-origin |\n"
#| "| 401 after token change | Update client settings; revoke old tokens if needed                 |\n"
msgid ""
"| Symptom                | Check                                                                |\n"
"| ---------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| Cannot reach Habitat       | Is Habitat running? `anima service status`; check `http.host` / firewall |\n"
"| 401                    | Client token valid; run `anima token list --subject-id <id>`         |\n"
"| Local OK, remote fails | Remote requests need Bearer / SAP auth_token                         |\n"
"| CORS error in browser  | Add UI origin to `http.cors_origins`, or use Habitat `/web` same-origin  |\n"
"| 401 after token change | Update client settings; revoke old tokens if needed                  |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 现象                         | 检查                                                      |\n"
"| ------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| 公网 502                      | Habitat 是否在运行？`anima service status`                     |\n"
"| 公网 1033                     | `anima tunnel status` 显示 `connected: no`                |\n"
"| 401                             | 客户端 token 是否与 `remote_auth.token` 一致                   |\n"
"| 本地正常、远程失败          | 远程请求需 Bearer / SAP auth_token；公网 Host 需 token |\n"
"| 更换 token 后 401        | 更新 Habitat 配置**并**所有客户端设置页        |\n"

